# Host Forensics: field kit USB tooling and disk/image forensics.
# Field kit host tooling (snapshot-fieldkit-prep / -import). snapshot-fieldkit
# recommends these, and recommends are off, so they are listed here:
# - exFAT for the stick (mkfs.exfat); dosfstools (FAT32) is in the installer list;
exfatprogs
# - udisks2: the import mounts the stick read-only as the operator, through
#   udisksctl, without root.
udisks2
# fdisk, util-linux, jq, rsync and busybox are already in the base image.
# Evidence handling on both arches: The Sleuth Kit CLI (mmls, fsstat, fls,
# icat, tsk_recover) and TestDisk/PhotoRec. Deeper analysis (Autopsy) runs on a
# separate workstation after the field kit hand-off (docs/fieldkit.md).
sleuthkit
testdisk
